{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03958","headline":"奉和送金城公主入西蕃应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和送金城公主入西蕃应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外馆踰河右，行营指路岐。\n和亲悲远嫁，忍爱泣将离。\n旌斾羗风引，轩车汉月随。\n那堪马上曲，时向管中吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}